  "prefLabel": "Plc 302.03 Contact individual",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 302.03 “Contact individual” means the individual who has been duly authorized by an entity to interact with the OPLC regarding licensing issues. The authorized signer and the contact individual may be, but are not required to be, the same individual.\n\nSource. #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300); ss by #14137, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 302.06)",
